Opens the texture file at #getSrc, decoding it into #getPixels :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`
:raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`

If the file does not exist, #hasImage becomes ``false`` and #getPixels is cleared
</verbatim> </para>
        </detaileddescription>
